      <h2>Short-term storage when downsizing or moving house</h2>
      <p><strong>Short answer:</strong> storage lets older people and their families move out of a home on one date and into the next on another, or keep furniture and belongings that will not fit in a smaller property, without rushing either decision. Chayce books secure, insured storage for belongings not moving straight into your new home, and arranges collection and delivery alongside your fully insured removal.</p>
      <p>Storage is useful in a few common situations: you are downsizing and are not yet sure what will fit, your sale completes before your new home is ready, or you want to stage your current home for sale with some furniture removed.</p>

      <h2>How it works with Chayce</h2>
      <p>Chayce handles the booking, and arranges collection from your home and delivery when you are ready. You do not need to find, compare or manage a storage provider yourself. Storage sits alongside the rest of your move, so the same coordinator who plans your sorting, packing and removal also plans when your belongings go in and when they come back out.</p>

      <h2>Which packages include storage</h2>
      <p>Our <a href="/gold-prestige/">Gold Prestige</a> package, from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("gold")).price | gbp }}, includes up to 6 weeks of storage, specifically to bridge the gap when your sale completion and your new-home move-in date do not match. See <a href="/packages/">all packages and prices</a> to compare what each includes.</p>

      <h2>Storage near Northampton and across the UK</h2>
      <p>We are based in Northampton and arrange later-life moves across the UK. Tell us where you are moving from and to when you contact us, and we will explain how storage would fit around your dates. See also <a href="/northampton/">senior movers in Northampton</a> and our <a href="/areas-we-cover/">areas we cover</a>.</p>
      <div class="area-honest">
        <p>Ask us about your dates. Call <a href="tel:+447708925432">{{ site.telephoneDisplay }}</a> or email {{ site.email }}, open {{ site.openingHoursText }}.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>Is the storage secure and insured?</summary><p>Yes. We arrange secure, insured storage for belongings not moving straight into your new home.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long can I store my belongings?</summary><p>Gold Prestige includes up to 6 weeks of storage. If you need longer, talk to us when you plan your move so we can explain the options.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if my sale and my new home do not line up?</summary><p>That is exactly what storage is for. Up to 6 weeks of storage is included in Gold Prestige to bridge a gap between your sale completion and your new-home move-in date.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I store furniture while I am downsizing?</summary><p>Yes. If your new home is smaller, or you are not yet sure what will fit, Chayce can book secure, insured storage for furniture and belongings and arrange collection and delivery when you need them.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do I have to arrange the storage myself?</summary><p>No. Chayce handles booking the storage and arranging collection or delivery when you need it.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

